title: Loan, Savings and Emission
subtitle: Treasury: a domestic loan, savings, emission financing or better tax collection.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'finance_package') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.finance_package (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.3). Z — 0.66 (decision 1A of 7 X 2026):
// the Treasury family has two cards, the taxes (polish_gov_finance) and the loan, savings and emission
// (polish_gov_finance_funding); both use the same rules of 11.9. Opening and closing the card are free; a confirmed option
// costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser who opened the card.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'finance_package');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_finance_funding');
!}

= Loan, savings and emission

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

One instrument per decision, voted by the Sejm at once; one instrument of each kind can be in force, and a temporary revenue ends when it expires.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @loan
- @admin_cuts
- @benefit_cut
- @emission
- @collection
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@loan
title: Domestic loan
subtitle: Brings the budget 3 units a month for six months, then costs it 1 unit a month for twelve months. Needs credit of at least 40.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'loan').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_loan_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'loan');
!}
go-to: result

@admin_cuts
title: Savings in named administrative spending
subtitle: Brings the budget 1 unit a month for six months; the discontent of the public employees named grows (+4).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'admin_cuts').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_admin_cuts_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'admin_cuts');
!}
go-to: result

@benefit_cut
title: Savings: cut the unemployment benefit
subtitle: Only the difference of the real cost, from 2 to 1 budget unit, and a change of the law; Lewica dissent rises (+8).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'benefit_cut').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_benefit_cut_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'benefit_cut');
!}
go-to: result

@emission
title: Emission financing
subtitle: Before the złoty: printing within an authorised limit of 1–3 points; after it: transitional coinage, 1 point for three months.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'emission').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_emission_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'emission');
!}
go-to: result

@collection
title: Improve tax collection
subtitle: Costs the budget 1 unit a month for two months, then brings it 1 unit a month for good; once in the chapter.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'finance_package', 'collection').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_finance_package_collection_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'finance_package', 'collection');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

